\subsection*{Critical reflection}


The use of AI tools in this activity has been helpful as a supporting resource, contributing to a more efficient workflow. In particular, these tools have helped clarify specific questions and facilitate the understanding of certain concepts.

They have also provided suggestions for identifying potential errors and improving the language used in the report, which has been particularly useful given that English is not our native language.

However, AI tools also have certain limitations. Therefore, it has been necessary to critically review each response and assess its accuracy and relevance in relation to the knowledge acquired and the course materials. These tools have been used to complement our own work rather than replace our own reasoning and decision-making.

In conclusion, AI has helped make certain aspects of the work more efficient and improve its overall presentation. Nevertheless, all AI-generated suggestions have been carefully reviewed and checked before being incorporated into the final report.




